# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor/backup files
*.bak*
*.backup.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large regenerable pipeline intermediates (~406 MB).
# Rebuild from Review_Collection/ (the raw scraped corpus, which IS committed):
#   python run_preprocessing.py   -> output/cleaned_data/
#   python run_extraction.py      -> output/extraction/
#   python run_analysis.py        -> output/analysis/
#   python run_aggregation.py     -> output/aggregation/  (committed - small)
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   output/aggregation/  - _poi_profiles.json, consumed by the RAG Explore UI
#   output/evaluation/   - hand-annotated gold labels, not reproducible
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
output/cleaned_data/
output/analysis/
output/extraction/
